            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Data from yesterday is filtered </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>since the calculation of the metric `% Next Fail Order (Item Unavailable) with the same product (Next day)  ` depends on the order data from the next day. If yesterday data is shown here, the metric will always shown a misleading dropping trend.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Only GoDroid data is included here</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>, since GoWin does not keep track of which product is marked unavailable </run>
              </formatted-text>
