              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>New Vendor</run>
                <run>
Vendors has done their first order within the last 28 days from the respective date.

</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Vendor Grade</run>
                <run>&#10;A: Vendors have contrubed </run>
                <run bold='true'>more than 50%</run>
                <run> of total orders within the entity in the previous week.
B: Vendors have contrubed  </run>
                <run bold='true'>30% ~ 50%</run>
                <run> of total orders within the entity in the previous week.
C: Vendors have contrubed  </run>
                <run bold='true'>10% ~ 30%</run>
                <run> of total orders within the entity in the previous week.
D: Vendors have contrubed  </run>
                <run bold='true'>less than 10%</run>
                <run> of total orders within the entity in the previous week.
NA: Vendors didn&apos;t contrubed  any order in the previous week.

</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Dormant Vendor</run>
                <run>
Vendors have done 0 order within the last 7 days from the respective date.

</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Inoperative Vendor</run>
                <run>
Vendors have done at least 1 order within the last 7 days from the respective date, but none of them was successful.

</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Unengaged Vendor</run>
                <run>
Vendors have done least than 21 orders within the last 7 days from the respective date.
</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='shape' value='Icons/information_icon.png' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
